      "title_1": "<span style=\"color: rgb(28, 28, 28); font-family: &quot;DM Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 500; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Moreno Beach Bali</span>",
      "desc_1": "Italian-Indonesian fusion right on the sand.\n                Great for arriving weary travellers who want to ease in gently. Pasta, fresh barramundi. Jl. Segara Ayu\n                No.42",
